-- Known T-Bank categories (FIN-200, owner's decision of 20.10.2026). There is no full registry
-- of T-Bank categories: the known list is the 51 bank categories collected from the owner's
-- statement in fixtures/calc/categories.json of fin-assist/contracts (FIN-107, docs/calc.md 3.1),
-- in the order of that file. name and bank_name are the name as the statement writes it;
-- «Ремонт и мебель» has a no-break space (U+00A0), as in the bank's MEMO.
-- sort_order continues the system categories (10, 20, 30) in steps of 10.
-- A category added to the list later is a new migration (and a service release).
